        blob.set("shield_freq_strength", feq, s)

    yield SUCCESS

=== elite_update_science_status
" DEPRECATED - say what is true and let the status tab render it.
"
" This used to BE the status tab: it read back its own last output, spliced a new
" segment in after an "Elite Status: " marker, and used a line starting with
" "Dynamic" as a sentinel meaning "empty". Three faults came with that. It wrote
" once per player ship for a value the engine stores per SIDE. It never took a line
" down, so an enemy that cloaked once read as cloaking for the rest of the mission.
" And it hardcoded the text of another addon's placeholder.
"
" Now it only records what is true; science_scans/science_status.py composes the
" line and owns the writing. Kept because a mission may call this by name.
    default status = ""
    ->END if ELITE_ID is None
    elite_status_set(ELITE_ID, status)
